      "writtenOn": "2023-09-05T14:40:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think this is more expensive than it needs to be. getUidRule fetches the bitmap of all the rules from the map, but then it ORs them with the requested rule. This loop will call it once per enabled firewall chain, i.e., up to 8 times. Instead we should just get the rule bitmap once, OR it with the bitmap of enabled chains, and operate on the resulting bitmap.",
